---
description: Enforce modern Angular 19 patterns using Signals and Standalone components.
globs: src/app/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: true
---
- Use **Angular Signals** (`signal`, `computed`, `effect`) for all local state.
- Use **`inject()`** for dependency injection instead of constructor-based DI.
- Strictly use **Standalone Components**; avoid NgModules.
- Use modern control flow (`@if`, `@for`, `@switch`) instead of `*ngIf` or `*ngFor`.
- Enforce `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush` on every component for performance.
